# Contributor docs that explain how to skip tests are not test code.
expect: clean
-- old/CONTRIBUTING.md --
# Contributing

Run `npm test` before opening a pull request.
-- new/CONTRIBUTING.md --
# Contributing

Run `npm test` before opening a pull request.

Never commit `it.skip`, `xit`, `@pytest.mark.skip` or `t.Skip()` to make CI
pass. If a test is genuinely blocked, open an issue and link it in the skip
reason, e.g. `@pytest.mark.skip(reason="see #123")`.
